---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const cols = [
  {
    title: "カテゴリ",
    links: [
      { label: "合戦と戦略",   href: "/category/battle/" },
      { label: "武将の思想",   href: "/category/leader/" },
      { label: "兵法・現代応用", href: "/category/strategy/" },
      { label: "映画・SF",     href: "/category/movie/" },
      { label: "歴史のIF",     href: "/category/whatif/" },
      { label: "書籍レビュー", href: "/category/books/" },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "サイト情報",
    links: [
      { label: "記事一覧",           href: "/blog/" },
      { label: "おすすめ書籍",       href: "/books/" },
      { label: "このブログについて", href: "/about/" },
      { label: "プライバシーポリシー", href: "/privacy/" },
    ],
  },
];
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-top">
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a href="/" class="footer-logo">
          決断の<em>系譜</em>
        </a>
        <p class="footer-tagline">歴史の選択が、未来を変える。</p>
        <p class="footer-desc">
          古今東西の英傑たちの決断を深掘りする歴史×戦略ブログ。戦国から世界史、映画・SF、そして「あの時、もし違う選択をしていたら」まで。
        </p>
        <div class="footer-social">
          <a href="https://note.com/ketsudan_keifu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-btn">
            note
          </a>
          <a href="https://substack.com/@kettsudan_keifu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-btn">
            Substack
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="フッターナビ">
        {cols.map(col => (
          <div class="footer-col">
            <h3 class="footer-col-title">{col.title}</h3>
            <ul>
              {col.links.map(({ label, href }) => (
                <li><a href={href}>{label}</a></li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <div class="container footer-bottom-inner">
      <p class="copy">&copy; {year} 決断の系譜. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p class="affiliate-notice">
        本サイトはAmazonアソシエイトプログラム・U-NEXTアフィリエイトプログラムに参加しています。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-xl);
    padding-top: var(--sp-xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--sp-lg);
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .footer-logo em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .footer-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .footer-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--ink3);
    max-width: 360px;
  }

  .footer-social {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
  }
  .social-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--ink2);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .social-btn:hover {
    color: var(--gold);
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }

  .footer-nav {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-lg);
  }

  .footer-col-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .footer-col ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .footer-col a {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink2);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .footer-col a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 1.2rem 0;
    background: var(--bg2);
  }

  .footer-bottom-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .copy, .affiliate-notice {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink3);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-lg);
    }
    .footer-bottom-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
